      "id": 1,
      "text": "Diana is an unincorporated community in Upshur County, Texas, located north of Longview and south of Ore City on U.S. Highway 259.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
